WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:16.976
Sara was so hungry and tired, she drifted off to sleep quickly.

2
00:00:16.977 --> 00:00:20.310
She did not know how long she slept.

3
00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:24.424
She also did not know what woke her up in the middle of the night.

4
00:00:24.425 --> 00:00:30.477
It had been a noise. The skylight had made a small click as it closed.

5
00:00:30.478 --> 00:00:36.805
Now a man dressed in white crouched on the roof and secretly watched Sara.

6
00:00:36.806 --> 00:00:41.097
At first when Sara woke up, she did not open her eyes.

7
00:00:41.098 --> 00:00:48.392
She felt too sleepy. Strangely enough, she also felt warm and comfortable.

8
00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:54.589
"I must be dreaming," she murmured. "This is such a nice dream.

9
00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:59.843
I'll keep my eyes closed. I don't want to wake up."

10
00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:04.462
Sara thought that warm blankets were heaped upon her bed.

11
00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:09.147
She reached out her hand and touched a down quilt.

12
00:01:09.148 --> 00:01:12.912
Then she heard a fire crackling.

13
00:01:12.913 --> 00:01:18.846
"Oh, this is so lovely." She squeezed her eyes tighter.

14
00:01:18.847 --> 00:01:22.506
"I must make this dream last."

15
00:01:22.507 --> 00:01:25.468
But she kept waking up.

16
00:01:25.469 --> 00:01:29.692
Sara finally opened her eyes and looked around her room.

17
00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:34.925
To her astonishment she saw a real fire glowing in the fireplace.

18
00:01:34.926 --> 00:01:38.416
A brass kettle was bubbling and hissing.

19
00:01:38.417 --> 00:01:41.944
There was a thick red rug on the floor.

20
00:01:41.945 --> 00:01:46.090
In front of the fire stood a small table and chair.

21
00:01:46.091 --> 00:01:50.240
Upon the table were several covered dishes and a teapot.

22
00:01:50.241 --> 00:01:55.695
A bright lamp with a pink shade gave the room a rosy glow.

23
00:01:55.696 --> 00:01:58.876
Sara's bed was covered with new blankets.

24
00:01:58.877 --> 00:02:04.866
At the foot of the bed were a red silk robe, a pair of slippers, and some books.

25
00:02:04.867 --> 00:02:08.653
It looked to Sara like a fairyland.

26
00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:11.747
"This can't be real!" said Sara.

27
00:02:11.748 --> 00:02:16.018
"I'm getting out of bed now, but I must still be dreaming.

28
00:02:16.019 --> 00:02:20.197
Yet everything looks real!"

29
00:02:20.198 --> 00:02:25.318
She stepped near the blazing fire and spread out her hands.

30
00:02:25.319 --> 00:02:30.516
"It's hot! A fire in a dream wouldn't be hot!"

31
00:02:30.517 --> 00:02:37.778
Sara dashed around the room, touching the table, the dishes, the rug.

32
00:02:37.779 --> 00:02:41.268
She picked up the red robe and held it to her cheek.

33
00:02:41.269 --> 00:02:52.208
"It's warm! It's soft!" She almost sobbed. "It's all real. It must be!"

34
00:02:52.209 --> 00:02:55.869
She put on the robe and stepped into the slippers.

35
00:02:55.870 --> 00:03:02.740
"They're real too! I am not—I am not dreaming!"

36
00:03:02.741 --> 00:03:07.208
Sara almost staggered to the books.

37
00:03:07.209 --> 00:03:11.273
She opened the one on top of the pile and found a message:

38
00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:15.494
To the little girl in the attic. From a friend.

39
00:03:15.495 --> 00:03:19.850
She put her face down on the page and burst into tears.

40
00:03:19.851 --> 00:03:29.037
"I don't know who it is, but somebody cares about me. I have a friend."

41
00:03:29.038 --> 00:03:34.833
Sara took her candle and slipped into Becky's room.

42
00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:37.915
She stood quietly by Becky's bed.

43
00:03:37.916 --> 00:03:43.470
"Becky! Becky! Wake up!" she whispered as loudly as she dared.

44
00:03:43.471 --> 00:03:47.210
Startled out of sleep, Becky sat upright.

45
00:03:47.211 --> 00:03:50.288
Her face was still smudged with tears.

46
00:03:50.289 --> 00:03:54.261
She was frightened until she realized Sara had awoken her.

47
00:03:54.262 --> 00:04:00.300
Dressed in a beautiful red robe and holding a candle, Sara looked like a princess.

48
00:04:00.301 --> 00:04:05.842
"Come with me," said Sara. "Becky, you must come at once."

49
00:04:05.843 --> 00:04:09.850
Becky was still too dazed to speak.

50
00:04:09.851 --> 00:04:17.472
She simply got up and followed Sara, her mouth and eyes wide open.

51
00:04:17.473 --> 00:04:23.817
When they reached Sara's room, Sara pulled Becky into the warm, glowing room.

52
00:04:23.818 --> 00:04:26.512
Becky could not believe her eyes.

53
00:04:26.513 --> 00:04:30.352
She blinked and asked, "Is it real, miss?"

54
00:04:30.353 --> 00:04:34.733
Sara nodded. "It's real!" she said.

55
00:04:34.734 --> 00:04:38.921
"I've touched everything, and it's all as real as we are.

56
00:04:38.922 --> 00:04:44.866
Something magical has happened while we slept."

57
00:04:44.867 --> 00:04:51.426
For the rest of the night, the two girls sat by the fire and enjoyed a hot, tasty meal.

58
00:04:51.427 --> 00:04:55.007
The covered dishes contained delicious soup.

59
00:04:55.008 --> 00:05:00.461
There were also sandwiches, muffins, and tea for both of them.

60
00:05:00.462 --> 00:05:03.212
Becky sipped the tea with pleasure.

61
00:05:03.213 --> 00:05:09.600
It was so delicious, it was not necessary to pretend it was anything but tea!

62
00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:14.887
"I don't know anyone who could have done this for me," Sara murmured.

63
00:05:14.888 --> 00:05:18.775
"Whoever it is, Becky, I have a friend."

64
00:05:18.776 --> 00:05:23.265
"Do you think it could all disappear?" asked Becky.

65
00:05:23.266 --> 00:05:27.989
"Maybe we should eat quickly." She crammed a sandwich into her mouth.

66
00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:33.888
"No, it won't disappear," Sara replied. "Take your time."

67
00:05:33.889 --> 00:05:38.487
The girls slowly ate their meal while they talked.

68
00:05:38.488 --> 00:05:43.631
Soon they felt warm, happy, and sleepy.

69
00:05:43.632 --> 00:05:52.348
When it was time to go back to bed, Sara realized that she had more than enough blankets.

70
00:05:52.349 --> 00:05:56.640
"Here, Becky. Take some blankets for your bed," she said.

71
00:05:56.641 --> 00:06:00.347
"Oh, thank you, miss!" Becky said.

72
00:06:00.348 --> 00:06:02.255
Becky got ready to go.

73
00:06:02.256 --> 00:06:06.170
At the door she turned for one last look at the room.

74
00:06:06.171 --> 00:06:10.005
"It's so beautiful!" she said.

75
00:06:10.006 --> 00:06:19.258
"If it all disappears tomorrow, I don't want to forget any of it."
